{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10118","headline":"送崔侍御入朝 · 李嘉佑","name":"送崔侍御入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年犹执宪，万里独归春。\n旧国逢芳草，青云见故人。\n潘郎今发白，陶令本家贫。\n相送临京口，停桡泪满巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}